cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use Blaeu in academic work, please cite it as below.'
title: Blaeu
abstract: >-
  A plugin-first geospatial editing kernel in TypeScript: MapLibre GL rendering, a GeoJSON
  feature store, a proj4/EPSG working CRS, snapping as interaction middleware, cross-plugin
  undo/redo, and JSTS topology validation — with cadastre, urban-planning and game
  level-editor presets on one unforked core.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Çelik
    given-names: Gökhun
    alias: celikgo
repository-code: 'https://github.com/celikgo/blaeu-lib'
url: 'https://github.com/celikgo/blaeu-lib'
license: MIT
version: 0.1.1
keywords:
  - geospatial
  - gis
  - maplibre
  - map-editor
  - plugin-architecture
  - typescript
  - geojson
  - coordinate-systems
  - topology
  - cadastre
